description	"Sith Officer 

Ruthless Customizable Hybrid Leaders with high tech weaponry and martial skills who can strike fear in ally and enemy alike.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 15% faster Movement
> Vibrosword (Yellow/Red/Purple)
-- 5% less Reach
> Vibrostaff (Staff)
-- 19% more Reach
- Heavy Sith Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag Reload
-- 15% faster Movement
-- 25% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 40% Mess RoF
-- Alt Fire Disabled
-- Less Clip size

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (3)
- Rally
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]"
- Repremand (Resource Dispenser 1) ^3
- Medpac ^3[CS4]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
